# 🚀 Things I've Built

## 🧠 Cerebro OS
A Mac automation system that acts like a smarter version of Siri or Raycast. The idea is to let the system understand vague intent and orchestrate actions across apps.

Demo:  
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g9PY_HKNFp0

Product spec:  
https://pollen-dibble-3dc.notion.site/Cerebro-OS-2c420c415bfc8004ae86e49f4e99154d?pvs=73

---

## 📰 Cerebros News
A news app that surfaces multiple perspectives on the same story and highlights gaps, bias, and missing context so readers can understand how narratives form around events.

Repo:  
https://github.com/maghams62/CerebrosNews

Demo:  
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iRPYEIBlUDA

---

## 🌐 Event Capture
A Chrome plugin for collecting browsing interaction data to help teach a bot how to crawl and understand the web.

Repo:  
https://github.com/jclymo/event-capture

---

## 🧾 Doc Extractor
A pipeline for extracting structured information from documents (such as passports and immigration forms) and converting them into data that can automatically fill workflows.

Repo:  
https://github.com/maghams62/doc-extractor

---

## 🎵 TikTok News
An experiment in presenting news in a swipeable, TikTok-style interface for faster discovery and consumption with verification.

Repo:  
https://github.com/maghams62/TikTokNews

---

## 🧪 SimPulse
In the era of LLM-driven virality, SimPulse simulates how content might perform before it goes live. Think of it as a CMO's test bench for marketing experiments.

Project link:  
https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7396687470685405185/

---

## ⚽ Auto FPL
A cloud system that automatically manages my Fantasy Premier League team by evaluating player stats, fixtures, and performance signals.

---

